## PDF CLASSIFICATION

### PdfClassifier.cs — Two-Stage Classification

```
STAGE 1 — Amendment Detection (always runs first):
1. Call AmendmentDetector.Inspect(filePath).
2. If report.IsAmended == true:
   a. Log.Warning("AMENDED PDF: {filePath} — {report.Summary}");
   b. Serialize AmendmentReport to JSON → ./amended_pdf_log/{filename}.amendment.json
   c. Return PdfType.Amended immediately. Do NOT run Stage 2.

STAGE 2 — Digital vs Scanned (only for non-amended files):
3. Open with PdfDocument.Open(filePath).
4. Compute average word count across first 3 pages using page.GetWords().
5. > 20 words/page  → PdfType.Digital
6. 5–20 words/page  → PdfType.Mixed   (treat as Scanned)
7. < 5 words/page   → PdfType.Scanned
8. On any exception → PdfType.Scanned (safe default, log the error).
```

