## EXTRACTOR ROUTING

| PdfType  | Extractor              | Reason                                          |
|----------|------------------------|-------------------------------------------------|
| Digital  | DigitalPdfExtractor    | Clean file, PdfPig text is reliable             |
| Scanned  | ScannedPdfExtractor    | Image-only pages, OCR required                  |
| Mixed    | ScannedPdfExtractor    | Ambiguous — OCR is safer                        |
| Amended  | ScannedPdfExtractor    | Ghost text risk — OCR reads only visible layer  |

PdfType.Amended must NEVER reach DigitalPdfExtractor. Enforce with a guard clause.

