## TEMPLATE DETECTION

### TemplateDetector.cs

Method: `TemplateType Detect(string extractedText)`

**TemplateA** — Primary standard format:
Requires ALL of: "Tool List:", "Part Number:", "Operation:", "Machine Model:"
Column headers: "Tool No.", "Tool Name", "Consumable Tool Description" → Score ≥ 4 → TemplateA

**TemplateB** — Abbreviated headers:
Contains: "P/N:", "OP:", "W/C:", "Tool#" or "T#" → Score ≥ 3 → TemplateB

**TemplateC** — Legacy minimal:
Contains: "Part No", "Operation No", "Cutter No" or "Cutter Description" → Score ≥ 2 → TemplateC

**Unknown**: No match → log warning, write raw text to failed_extractions/, do not throw.

