## IMPLEMENTATION ORDER

Execute exactly in this order. Verify build compiles after each step:

1.  Solution scaffold: all `.csproj` files, package references. `dotnet restore`.
    Verify no license violations.
2.  Domain models and enums (all new fields included: SourceFileHash,
    RevisionConflictDetected, PageOrientation, SkippedFiles).
3.  Options classes (ToolingExtractorOptions and nested classes).
4.  ToolingDbContext + all indexes. Generate EF migration.
5.  StartupValidationService (AVX2, model files, allowed paths, output dirs, DB).
6.  FileHashService.
7.  AmendmentDetector.
8.  PdfClassifier (two-stage: amendment → word count).
9.  ImagePreprocessor (grayscale, Otsu binarize, deskew).
10. DigitalPdfExtractor (PdfPig, multi-line header handling, X-sort).
11. ScannedPdfExtractor (PaddleSharp, page-level semaphore, orientation detection,
    ImagePreprocessor call, X-sorted column reconstruction, dispose all bitmaps).
12. OcrTextCorrector.
13. TemplateDetector.
14. ParserA (dynamic header remapping, continuation row merge, multi-line fields).
15. ParserB, ParserC. ParserFactory.
16. FolderScanService (path validation with allowlist).
17. CsvExportService, ExcelExportService (3 sheets, amber/red row colors).
18. ExtractionPipelineService (hash dedup, ConcurrentBag, single writer, revision conflict).
19. Program.cs DI wiring + startup validation hosting.
20. Minimal API endpoints.
21. Razor Pages (Index, Extract, Results — all warning banners included).
22. Unit tests (all test classes listed above).
23. README.md (model setup, allowed paths, build, run, output dirs).
24. Final: `dotnet build` → 0 errors, 0 warnings. `dotnet test` → all green.

